96x96 image smoke fixtures: each original unsigned grayscale byte has been
replicated across RGB channels. Originals are person_image_data.cc and
no_person_image_data.cc in the official archive:
https://storage.googleapis.com/download.tensorflow.org/data/tf_lite_micro_person_data_int8_grayscale_2020_01_13.zip

These smoke witnesses are not an independent accuracy dataset. No physical
camera images are committed.

JPEG smoke inputs are baseline quality-81 encodings of those replicated RGB
fixtures, generated with Pillow; they retain the same license and attribution.
